{"t":"HWM","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"Howmet Aerospace Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":25430,"hq":"Pittsburgh, PA, United States","website":"https://www.howmet.com","summary_en":"Howmet Aerospace Inc. provides advanced engineered solutions for the aerospace and transportation industries in the United States, Japan, France, Germany, the United Kingdom, Mexico, Italy, Canada, Poland, China, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Engine Products, Fastening Systems, Engineered Structures, and Forged Wheels. The Engine Products segment offers airfoils and seamless rolled rings primarily for aircraft engines and industrial gas turbines; and rotating and structural parts. The Fastening Systems segment produces aerospace fastening systems, as well as commercial transportation, industrial, and other fasteners; and latches, bearings, fluid fittings, and installation tools. The Engineered Structures segment provides titanium ingots and mill products, aluminum and nickel forgings, and machined components and assemblies for aerospace and defense applications; and titanium forgings, extrusions, and forming and machining services for airframe, wing, aero-engine, and landing gear components. The Forged Wheels segment offers forged aluminum wheels and related products for heavy-duty trucks and commercial transportation markets. The company was formerly known as Arconic Inc. Howmet Aerospace Inc. was founded in 1888 and is based in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Howmet Aerospace Inc.는 미국, 일본, 프랑스, ​​독일, 영국, 멕시코, 이탈리아, 캐나다, 폴란드, 중국 및 국제적으로 항공우주 및 운송 산업을 위한 고급 엔지니어링 솔루션을 제공합니다. 엔진 제품, 고정 시스템, 엔지니어링 구조 및 단조 휠의 네 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 엔진 제품 부문은 주로 항공기 엔진 및 산업용 가스 터빈을 위한 익형 및 심리스 롤링 링을 제공합니다. 회전 및 구조 부품. 고정 시스템 부문은 항공우주 고정 시스템뿐만 아니라 상업용 운송, 산업용 및 기타 고정 장치를 생산합니다. 래치, 베어링, 유체 피팅 및 설치 도구. 엔지니어링 구조 부문은 항공우주 및 방위 응용 분야를 위한 티타늄 잉곳 및 압연 제품, 알루미늄 및 니켈 단조품, 기계 가공 부품 및 어셈블리를 제공합니다. 기체, 날개, 항공기 엔진 및 랜딩 기어 부품을 위한 티타늄 단조, 압출, 성형 및 가공 서비스 등이 있습니다. 단조 휠 부문은 대형 트럭 및 상업용 운송 시장을 위한 단조 알루미늄 휠 및 관련 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Arconic Inc.로 알려져 있었습니다. Howmet Aerospace Inc.는 1888년에 설립되었으며 펜실베니아주 피츠버그에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":220.355,"mcap":87626473472.0,"pe":43.206863,"fpe":33.152042,"peg":null,"ps":9.004878,"pb":15.207384,"ev_ebitda":29.475,"div":0.26,"beta":1.295,"hi52":310.0,"lo52":183.52},"fin":{"rev":9731000320.0,"rev_g":0.294,"eps_g":0.495,"gross":0.36625,"op":0.28783,"net":0.21098,"roe":0.37652,"fcf":1291250048.0,"cash":507000000.0,"debt":4621000192.0,"de":80.198,"eps":5.1,"feps":6.6468},"own":{"short":0.0269,"inst":0.93935996,"insider":0.0088599995},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":296.2857,"median":298.0,"high":375.0,"low":230.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.36364,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":16,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":16,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Sector Weight","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":237.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":350.0,"priorPriceTarget":370.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"BTIG","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":280.0,"priorPriceTarget":340.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":230.0,"priorPriceTarget":255.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"BNP Paribas","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTar